WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.604 --> 00:00:10.506
Row two: Deild, Námsbraut and Ár
(department, study programme, year).

2
00:00:10.606 --> 00:00:16.507
Deild: pick the department from
Ugla's list – or type its name.

3
00:00:16.607 --> 00:00:21.600
Námsbraut: the study programmes
in the programs sheet.

4
00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:27.154
Ár: one or more study years.

5
00:00:27.254 --> 00:00:32.155
Red outline: skylda (mandatory)
in the chosen years.

6
00:00:32.255 --> 00:00:38.157
Yellow: bundið val (restricted
elective). Electives: no outline.

7
00:00:38.257 --> 00:00:45.158
Below: the programme's courses taught
this term that are not in the timetable.

8
00:00:45.258 --> 00:00:54.068
Add one with Bæta við –
it drops off the list.

9
00:00:54.168 --> 00:00:59.069
All of this is saved at once –
no Vista needed.

10
00:00:59.169 --> 00:01:04.071
On the web it is filed under
its Deild and Námsbraut.

11
00:01:04.171 --> 00:01:10.073
Each Deild and Námsbraut has
a page listing its stundatöflur.

12
00:01:10.173 --> 00:01:16.076
Spoi → Uppfæra stundatöflur á vef
updates every one on the web.

13
00:01:16.176 --> 00:01:22.078
Já: all with teacher names.
Nei: each as it was set.

14
00:01:22.178 --> 00:01:28.078
Publishing starts – unchanged
pages are left as they are.
